{"success":true,"value":"Thanks dormento! Really appreciate you checking it out.

The effects feedback is fair — the website demo page has them, but the actual app itself is clean/minimal. I'll tone them down on the site too though.

On the naming — totally get it's not for everyone. The metaphor started as internal dev shorthand that stuck, but you're right that plain naming would be more discoverable. I'll add a glossary/README section mapping the terms to their actual functions so it's easier to navigate regardless. Appreciate the honest take 🙏"}
